estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: "import type { ProjectedGraphResult } from '@unbrained/pm-cli/sdk/graph' and from '@unbrained/pm-cli/sdk' compile under NodeNext with strict and skipLibCheck false; The conflict_resolution union of MergeDecisionReceipt has an exported public name (for example MergeConflictResolution) that the receipt declaration uses, importable from sdk/merge and from the aggregate entrypoint; The SDK surface gate fails when a type referenced by an exported function's public signature is not importable from the same entrypoint, with a negative control that removes one such re-export; A packed-consumer fixture with type-only imports of these names runs beside the existing value-export parity checks"
parent: pm-9rgaal
