repro_steps: "In a NodeNext strict project with skipLibCheck false: import type { ProjectedGraphResult } from '@unbrained/pm-cli/sdk/graph' fails with TS2305"
expected_result: Types named in public SDK signatures are importable by name from the entrypoint that exports the function
actual_result: TS2305 for ProjectedGraphResult from sdk/graph and for a merge conflict-resolution alias from sdk/merge
affected_version: 2026.11.4
